":"Person: Debian GCC Maintainers \\u003cdebian-gcc@lists.debian.org\\u003e","originator":"Person: Debian GCC Maintainers \\u003cdebian-gcc@lists.debian.org\\u003e","downloadLocation":"NOASSERTION","filesAnalyzed":true,"licenseConcluded":"NOASSERTION","licenseDeclared":"BSD-2-Clause OR LGPL-2.0-only OR LGPL-2.1-or-later OR MIT","description":"manipulating sets and relations of integer points bounded by linear constraints\n isl is a library for manipulating sets and relations of integer points\n bounded by linear constraints. Supported operations on sets include\n intersection, union, set difference, emptiness check, convex hull,\n (integer) affine hull, integer projection, and computing the lexicographic\n minimum using parametric integer programming. It also includes an ILP solver\n based on generalized basis reduction.\n .\n This package contains the runtime library.","externalRefs":[{"referenceCategory":"PACKAGE-MANAGER","referenceType":"purl","referenceLocator":"pkg:deb/debian/isl@0.27-1?os_distro=trixie\u0026os_name=debian\u0026os_version=13"}]},{"name":"jansson","SPDXID":"SPDXRef-Package-7018666cd071d7b6d182f7e017161ff6","versionInfo":"2.14-2","supplier":"Person: Alessandro Ghedini \\u003cghedo@debian.org\\u003e","originator":"Person: Alessandro Ghedini \\u003cghedo@debian.org\\u003e","downloadLocation":"NOASSERTION","filesAnalyzed":true,"licenseConcluded":"NOASSERTION","description":"C library for encoding, decoding and manipulating JSON data\n Jansson is a C library for encoding, decoding and manipulating JSON data.\n .\n It features:\n * Simple and intuitive API and data model\n * Comprehensive documentation\n * No dependencies on other libraries\n * Full Unicode support (UTF-8)\n * Extensive test suite","externalRefs":[{"referenceCategory":"PACKAGE-MANAGER","referenceType":"purl","referenceLocator":"pkg:deb/debian/jansson@2.14-2?os_distro=trixie\u0026os_name=debian\u0026os_version=13"}]},{"name":"jbigkit","SPDXID":"SPDXRef-Package-438733d5db3934fbc34d79f9b